# Inside this project but outside its `[scan] include`: the link is what puts the
# file in the tree, so it is read there and its dangling citation is reported.
packages/other/docs/notes.md -> ../notes.md
# Into a sibling project: `sub` owns those files, so `other`'s walk stops here.
packages/other/docs/blink -> ../../sub
# Back up into the root project: the same boundary, read upwards.
packages/sub/docs/rootdocs -> ../../../docs
